<time>2026-04-22T12:18:37Z</time>
<name>Start to Allbrook Lock</name>
<desc>Start at Pitmore Road where there is roadside parking. Head down the hill and, at the end of Pitmore Road, turn left into Highbridge Road. Once you are on Highbridge Road, go under the railway bridge. You will hear the water rushing through Allbrook Lock. Go past the lock and turn immediately left down the footpath. </desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
<extensions>
<xstyle:fill>
<xstyle:color>ff0000</xstyle:color>
</xstyle:fill>
</extensions>
